ward the buried drift entrance."},{"worldId":"the-undersong-world","createdAt":1792195200000,"updatedAt":1792195200000,"id":"undersong-snapshot-8-2-2-ezra","characterId":"undersong-char-ezra","eventId":"undersong-event-8-2-2","isAlive":true,"currentLocationMarkerId":"undersong-loc-hollow","currentMapLayerId":"undersong-map-drift","inventoryItemIds":["undersong-item-watch"],"inventoryNotes":"","travelModeId":null,"sortKey":39,"statusNotes":"Accepts the returned watch and steps back from the darkness because he still has promises to keep."},{"worldId":"the-undersong-world","createdAt":1792195200000,"updatedAt":1792195200000,"id":"undersong-snapshot-8-2-2-tom","characterId":"undersong-char-tom","eventId":"undersong-event-8-2-2","isAlive":true,"currentLocationMarkerId":"undersong-loc-hollow","currentMapLayerId":"undersong-map-drift","inventoryItemIds":[],"inventoryNotes":"","travelModeId":null,"sortKey":39.01,"statusNotes":"Returns the stone to the Hollow and walks away into the dark after looking toward his mother’s window."},{"worldId":"the-undersong-world","createdAt":1792195200000,"updatedAt":1792195200000,"id":"undersong-snapshot-8-2-2-wren","characterId":"undersong-char-wren","eventId":"undersong-event-8-2-2","isAlive":true,"currentLocationMarkerId":"undersong-loc-hollow","currentMapLayerId":"undersong-map-drift","inventoryItemIds":[],"inventoryNotes":"","travelModeId":null,"sortKey":39.02,"statusNotes":"Gives Ezra the cracked watch to keep dry and enters the Hollow with the boy."},{"worldId":"the-undersong-world","createdAt":1792195200000,"updatedAt":1792195200000,"id":"undersong-snapshot-8-3-1-ezra","characterId":"undersong-char-ezra","eventId":"undersong-event-8-3-1","isAlive":true,"currentLocationMarkerId":"undersong-loc-surgery","currentMapLayerId":"undersong-map-village","inventoryItemIds":[],"inventoryNotes":"","travelModeId":null,"sortKey":40,"statusNotes":"Rises from his surgery desk and sees the bay filled with ordinary calm black water."},{"worldId":"th