-char-ezra","type":"primary","text":"Record the wrong tides and determine what is happening to the village","startEventId":"undersong-event-1-1-1","endEventId":"undersong-event-8-3-3"},{"worldId":"the-undersong-world","createdAt":1792195200000,"updatedAt":1792195200000,"id":"undersong-goal-2","characterId":"undersong-char-agnes","type":"primary","text":"Preserve the children’s testimony and keep them under her care","startEventId":"undersong-event-1-3-1","endEventId":"undersong-event-7-2-2"},{"worldId":"the-undersong-world","createdAt":1792195200000,"updatedAt":1792195200000,"id":"undersong-goal-3","characterId":"undersong-char-ruth","type":"primary","text":"Bring Tom back from what has taken his attention","startEventId":"undersong-event-1-1-2","endEventId":"undersong-event-7-4-3"},{"worldId":"the-undersong-world","createdAt":1792195200000,"updatedAt":1792195200000,"id":"undersong-goal-4","characterId":"undersong-char-pell","type":"primary","text":"Measure and document the sound behind the fourth heading","startEventId":"undersong-event-2-2-1","endEventId":"undersong-event-4-2-1"},{"worldId":"the-undersong-world","createdAt":1792195200000,"updatedAt":1792195200000,"id":"undersong-goal-5","characterId":"undersong-char-silas","type":"primary","text":"Keep the forms of worship while the village seeks an answer","startEventId":"undersong-event-3-1-1","endEventId":"undersong-event-7-3-1"}],"mapRoutes":[{"worldId":"the-undersong-world","createdAt":1792195200000,"updatedAt":1792195200000,"id":"undersong-route-coast-road","mapLayerId":"undersong-map-coast","name":"Coastal road","routeType":"road","waypoints":[{"x":100,"y":870},{"x":240,"y":800},{"x":320,"y":740},{"x":390,"y":680},{"x":520,"y":655},{"x":670,"y":600},{"x":800,"y":550},{"x":880,"y":470},{"x":900,"y":410},{"x":1000,"y":360},{"x":1130,"y":280},{"x":1270,"y":260},{"x":1420,"y":210}],"color":"#8b674e","notes":"Path traced over the depicted road or gallery; the final breached connection into the Hollow is interpre